  "adaptations": [
    "Silver backgrounds/halos and the byte-identical export are not new styles. Classic application screenshots include different content/view states.",
    "Desktop-width application layouts show independent playlist-target panels at 480px and above. Narrow layouts retain navigation and open playlist targets in the main screen.",
